title: Culture and Science
subtitle: Education: monuments, universities and radio.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
face-image: img/polish/polish_gov_heritage_zamek_krolewski.jpg
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_heritage_wawel.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'heritage_restoration') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.heritage_restoration (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.16). Opening and closing the card
// are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card. Z — 0.97 (the
// sketch of 7 XI 2026): Culture and Science instead of “Wawel or the Royal Castle” — one restoration option (Wawel first, then
// the Royal Castle), the support of the universities and the public radio (decision 3: democracy +2).
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'heritage_restoration');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_heritage');
!}

= Culture and science

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The state can restore monuments, support the universities and build a radio. Each of these programmes costs the budget, but it builds the trust of the intelligentsia or the strength of democracy.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[? if pl_gc_projects : [+ pl_gc_projects +] ?]

- @heritage
- @science
- @radio
- @nothing
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@heritage
title: Restore [+ pl_gc_heritage_object +] and open it to visitors
subtitle: Cost: [+ pl_cost2 +]. The intelligentsia trusts PPS more (+3), and the credibility of the party grows (+2).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'heritage_restoration', 'heritage').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_heritage_restoration_heritage_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'heritage_restoration', 'heritage');
!}
go-to: result

@science
title: Support science and the universities
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget unit. The intelligentsia trusts PPS more (+3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'heritage_restoration', 'science').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_heritage_restoration_science_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'heritage_restoration', 'science');
!}
go-to: result

@radio
title: Build a public radio
subtitle: Cost: [+ pl_cost2 +]. People hear the news from the country and from the Sejm, and democracy grows stronger (+2).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'heritage_restoration', 'radio').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_heritage_restoration_radio_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'heritage_restoration', 'radio');
!}
go-to: result

@nothing
title: Do nothing now
subtitle: The card is played and comes back in three months.
on-arrival: {!
PolishRules.skipCard(Q);
!}
go-to: root

@result
new-page: true

= Culture and science

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
